// Rayn identity for the macOS targets, shared by Runner (through AppInfo.xcconfig)
// and the RaynTunnel extension (through RaynTunnel/RaynTunnel.xcconfig). The iOS
// counterpart is ios/Base.xcconfig.
//
// Team RPD5KQ8YA7 is Rayn Labs LLC. M7Q8ASP66Z and 3JFTY5BP58, both in this repo's
// history, are upstream Hiddify's and must never come back.

BASE_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.raynlabs.app
SERVICE_IDENTIFIER = com.raynlabs.app
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = RPD5KQ8YA7

// The app group the app and the extension share: the container that holds the
// working directory, and the keychain access group the config-sealing key and
// the gRPC secrets live under (ios/Shared/FilePath.swift reads it from the
// RaynAppGroup Info.plist key).
//
// Team-prefixed, the native macOS form: it needs no registration in the
// developer portal, works on macOS 12 to 14, and passes macOS 15's app-group
// container protection because the prefix matches the signing team. iOS uses
// group.com.raynlabs.app and sets no RaynAppGroup key.
//
// Built from DEVELOPMENT_TEAM rather than $(TeamIdentifierPrefix) so the value
// never depends on a setting Xcode derives during signing.
RAYN_APP_GROUP = $(DEVELOPMENT_TEAM).group.$(BASE_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)
